Fibonacci in maniT
==================

Recursive Fibonacci (n = 0..10):
  fib(0) = 0
  fib(1) = 1
  fib(2) = 1
  fib(3) = 2
  fib(4) = 3
  fib(5) = 5
  fib(6) = 8
  fib(7) = 13
  fib(8) = 21
  fib(9) = 34
  fib(10) = 55

Iterative Fibonacci (n = 0..20):
  fib(0) = 0
  fib(1) = 1
  fib(2) = 1
  fib(3) = 2
  fib(4) = 3
  fib(5) = 5
  fib(6) = 8
  fib(7) = 13
  fib(8) = 21
  fib(9) = 34
  fib(10) = 55
  fib(11) = 89
  fib(12) = 144
  fib(13) = 233
  fib(14) = 377
  fib(15) = 610
  fib(16) = 987
  fib(17) = 1597
  fib(18) = 2584
  fib(19) = 4181
  fib(20) = 6765

Safe Fibonacci with overflow detection:
  fib_safe(30) -> Ok(832040)
  fib_safe(50) -> Ok(12586269025)
  fib_safe(61) -> Ok(2504730781961)
  fib_safe(62) -> Err("overflow: fib(n) exceeds the 27-trit word range for n > 61")
  fib_safe(93) -> Err("overflow: fib(n) exceeds the 27-trit word range for n > 61")
  fib_safe(100) -> Err("overflow: fib(n) exceeds the 27-trit word range for n > 61")

F(n) mod 3 for n=0..15 (Pisano period 8):
  0, 1, 1, 2, 0, 2, 2, 1, 0, 1, 1, 2, 0, 2, 2, 1

F(n+1)/F(n) converging to golden ratio (phi ~ 1.618...):
  F(6)/F(5) = 1.600000
  F(11)/F(10) = 1.618181
  F(16)/F(15) = 1.618032
  F(21)/F(20) = 1.618033
  F(26)/F(25) = 1.618033
  F(31)/F(30) = 1.618033

Done.
